OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust apologises over
OL,4,Aorthodontic delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust has apologised after
OL,7,Fstaff shortages left some patients
OL,8,Fstruggling to book orthodontic
OL,9,Fappointments.
OL,11,FUnited Lincolnshire Teaching Hospitals
OL,12,FNHS Trust, which covers hospitals in
OL,13,FBoston, Lincoln and Grantham, said its
OL,14,Forthodontic service had been under
OL,15,Fsignificant staffing pressures, leading
OL,16,Fto limited appointment availability.
OL,18,FProf Ciro Rinaldi, chief medical
OL,19,Fofficer at Lincolnshire Community and
OL,20,FHospitals NHS Group, said the trust has
OL,21,Frecruited additional staff to address
OL,22,Fthe shortages within the service.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
